WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.648
Let's make a second version without losing the first. Main, then A puts the focus back on the drums.

2
00:00:05.728 --> 00:00:11.539
Press Copy, then pad nine. Your drum clip now has an independent copy in the next scene.

3
00:00:11.539 --> 00:00:16.304
Open Steps with Sixteen Level, and choose the snare with Shift and pad two.

4
00:00:16.304 --> 00:00:22.253
Pad three adds a snare just before the bar turns round. A small change is enough to make a different section.

5
00:00:22.253 --> 00:00:27.843
Undo takes that hit out. Shift and Undo brings it back. The original clip hasn't changed.

6
00:00:27.843 --> 00:00:33.591
Press Main. Both versions are there, ready to launch. Next we'll play them as parts of a track.
